# Force LF line endings for all text files on checkout, regardless of the
# checking-out machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows
# checkouts silently convert shell scripts (backend/docker/entrypoint.sh,
# .githooks/*) to CRLF, which breaks their "#!/bin/sh" shebang once copied
# into a Linux container ("exec /entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory").
* text=auto eol=lf
